t chaotic but doesn’t think about her allies before acting on temptation.","references":[]},{"index":5,"weight":1,"text":"Focused - Wants to play the game he signed up for, do what’s on his character sheet, and avoid too much of any one game aspect.","raw_text":"1,Focused - Wants to play the game he signed up for, do what’s on his character sheet, and avoid too much of any one game aspect.","references":[]},{"index":6,"weight":1,"text":"Skilled - Plays skilled or flexible characters; wants to show that off.","raw_text":"1,Skilled - Plays skilled or flexible characters; wants to show that off.","references":[]},{"index":7,"weight":1,"text":"Noble - Wants to do the right thing and sacrifice herself for the greater good, preferably while being recognized and suffering for it.","raw_text":"1,Noble - Wants to do the right thing and sacrifice herself for the greater good, preferably while being recognized and suffering for it.","references":[]},{"index":8,"weight":1,"text":"On Point - Brings his best game. Always pushes the story and adventure towards a dramatic and satisfying conclusion.","raw_text":"1,On Point - Brings his best game. Always pushes the story and adventure towards a dramatic and satisfying conclusion.","references":[]},{"index":9,"weight":1,"text":"Team-Player - Only interested in helping out the rest of the party. Doesn't focus too much on specializing his own character.","raw_text":"1,Team-Player - Only interested in helping out the rest of the party. Doesn't focus too much on specializing his own character.","references":[]},{"index":10,"weight":1,"text":"Joker - Interested in having a fun time, and being the comic relief, even if she has to break the fourth wall.","raw_text":"1,Joker - Interested in having a fun time, and being the comic relief, even if she has to break the fourth wall.","references":[]}],"dependencies":{"local_subtables":[],"external_subtables":[],"unresolved":[],"depended_on_by":["Player Emulator.main"]},"raw_source":";agenda\n1,Tru